# Observability Migrations

Alembic revisions for relational observability storage backends.

These migrations change technical runtime events and audit schemas. They do not
own primary application state or module data.

Use the runner:

```bash
python main.py create-migration observability -m "description" --autogenerate
python main.py migrate observability
python main.py rollback observability --steps 1
python main.py migration-status observability
```

The `clickhouse` backend uses dedicated schema bootstrap and does not use the
normal Alembic flow.
